      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay, i'll stick to the regular dose then. but i'm also thinking about that massage you mentioned earlier to help with the fluid. i was reading online that sometimes things like this can be a sign of a blood clot, which sounds terrifying. but i'm sure it's just standard post-op stuff, right? would doing a deep massage on that area help break up the fluid or something? i really just want this pressure to go away.",
